        {
          "title": "Variations",
          "subtitle": "Known ways this game changes",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "style": "unordered",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "With Ante: All players post an ante in addition to (or instead of) small and big blinds before the deal."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Two Draw Rounds: Some play with two drawing rounds, each followed by a betting round, instead of a single draw."
